    <UnitTestResult executionId="ed632b0a-8514-4692-ba58-3f9c9e277dc6" testId="e2559462-4d74-8a0c-8376-089058012f93" testName="BirkNext.Api.Tests.WorkflowApprovalFlowTest.CurrentWorkspaceMustBePersisstedForApprovalButtons" computerName="BUF-5CG4423FYV" duration="00:00:00.0029830" startTime="2026-08-17T13:58:05.8675479+02:00" endTime="2026-08-17T13:58:05.8675480+02:00" testType="13cdc9d9-ddb5-4fa4-a97d-d965ccfc6d4b" outcome="Passed" testListId="8c84fa94-04c1-424b-9868-57a2d4851a1d" relativeResultsDirectory="ed632b0a-8514-4692-ba58-3f9c9e277dc6">
      <Output>
        <StdOut>=== CRITICAL TEST: Current Workspace Persistence ===&#xD;
&#xD;
Problem: Approval buttons don't work because:&#xD;
1. AutoSave creates workspace but doesn't set it as CURRENT&#xD;
2. GetCurrentState() returns null WorkspaceId&#xD;
3. RecommendedWorkflow.GetWorkspaceId() returns Guid.Empty&#xD;
4. ApproveStepAsync calls WorkflowApi.ApproveStepAsync(Guid.Empty, stepKey)&#xD;
5. Backend rejects approval because WorkspaceId is empty&#xD;
&#xD;
Calling AutoSaveAsync (like browser does)...&#xD;
AutoSave returned workspace ID: 92884d99-7f24-4989-87a8-cb99200667ef&#xD;
GetCurrentState returns: 92884d99-7f24-4989-87a8-cb99200667ef&#xD;
&#xD;
FIX NEEDED:&#xD;
WorkspacePersistenceService.AutoSaveAsync should call&#xD;
SetCurrentWorkspaceAsync(workspace.Id) before returning</StdOut>
      </Output>
    </UnitTestResult>
